  concept: "Authored objective: LED.\nAuthored requirement: LED BULB\n Connection
    pair LED_Anode and LED_Cathode.\nGeneral teaching principle: An LED has a defined
    anode and cathode; correct polarity and suitable current control matter for normal
    forward operation.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that
    this objective is complete."
  analogy: A directional gate with a current limit is a useful model, although an
    LED is not an ideal one-way switch.
